[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 6960.79, "timestamp": "01:56:00", "text": "每次我玩游戏的时候，我都感觉很痛苦。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6962.629, "timestamp": "01:56:02", "text": "这场游戏，并没有。这真滑稽"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6965.109, "timestamp": "01:56:05", "text": "因为这件事在我……的时候并没有发生。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6971.91, "timestamp": "01:56:11", "text": "好的。呃，有人能帮帮我吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6974.55, "timestamp": "01:56:14", "text": "我有一个问题：你在哪里？是的。就在这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6977.589, "timestamp": "01:56:17", "text": "就在这里。这样可以。等待。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6980.629, "timestamp": "01:56:20", "text": "是的。我们走吧。是的。我们走吧。我可以吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6983.109, "timestamp": "01:56:23", "text": "等等？好的。慢慢地。我觉得我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6985.189, "timestamp": "01:56:25", "text": "拿着它。我觉得我拿着它。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6988.229, "timestamp": "01:56:28", "text": "我想我是。妈的。小心，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6990.629, "timestamp": "01:56:30", "text": "小心，小心。小心。我来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6993.669, "timestamp": "01:56:33", "text": "完全正确。是的。是的。我们来了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6996.55, "timestamp": "01:56:36", "text": "我该往哪个方向走？扩大。呃，我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6999.109, "timestamp": "01:56:39", "text": "需要像你的左边，我的右边那样走。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7002.47, "timestamp": "01:56:42", "text": "是的。正确的。正确的。是的。好的。稍微挪动一下"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7005.75, "timestamp": "01:56:45", "text": "向右。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7009.83, "timestamp": "01:56:49", "text": "好的。现在我们换个角度来看。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7013.51, "timestamp": "01:56:53", "text": "我们想要一些惠普。请把购物车拿走。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7016.39, "timestamp": "01:56:56", "text": "其实是因为……没关系。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7018.07, "timestamp": "01:56:58", "text": "没关系。没关系。没关系。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7019.75, "timestamp": "01:56:59", "text": "不过，它仍然很贵。它仍然是"}]